{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0054","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":19,"subject":"math","topic_key":"derivative_applications","total_weight":118,"expected_output":"screening-0054.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1248","source_sha256":"14d51891240ddcfd909ec7037fb5299dcffd09ef383013c42e7786db9bf333a7","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"تابع $y = \\frac{x^2 - 4x + 4}{x^2 + 1}$ در بازه $(a, b)$ اکیداً نزولی است. حداکثر $b - a$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1/5$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2/5$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"می‌دانیم:\n$(fog)'(x) = g'(x)f'(g(x))$\nابتدا $f'(x)$ را به دست می‌آوریم:\n$f(x) = 3x - \\frac{2}{x} \\Rightarrow f'(x) = 3 + \\frac{2}{x^2} \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} f(1) = 1 \\\\ f'(1) = 5 \\end{cases}$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$(gof)'(1) = 4 \\Rightarrow f'(1)g'(f(1)) = 4 \\Rightarrow 5g'(1) = 4$\n$\\Rightarrow g'(1) = \\frac{4}{5} = 0/8$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1248,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":1,"solution_page":117,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1249","source_sha256":"85ac01700b32323eb24b602dbe287ddff8832b19a7d1e2301c03efde85751d74","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"کدام عبارت برای تابع $f(x) = 2\\sqrt{x} - \\frac{3}{\\sqrt[3]{x^2 - 1}}$ درست است؟ (سراسری ۱۴۰۰)"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"تابع $f$ در بازه $(1, \\infty) \\cup (0, 1)$ صعودی است."}],[{"type":"text","text":"تابع $f$ در بازه‌های $(1, \\infty)$ و $(0, 1)$ صعودی است."}],[{"type":"text","text":"تابع $f$ در بازه $(1, \\infty)$ صعودی و در بازه $(0, 1)$ نزولی است."}],[{"type":"text","text":"تابع $f$ در بازه $(1, \\infty)$ نزولی و در بازه $(0, 1)$ صعودی است."}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا $f'(x)$ را به دست می‌آوریم:\n$f(x) = \\sqrt{x+5} + 1 \\Rightarrow f'(x) = \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x+5}} \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} f(4) = 4 \\\\ f'(4) = \\frac{1}{6} \\end{cases}$\nحال $(fof)'(4)$ را محاسبه می‌کنیم:\n$(fof)'(4) = f'(4)f'(f(4)) = \\frac{1}{6} f'(4) = \\frac{1}{6} \\times \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{1}{36}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1249,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":2,"solution_page":117,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1250","source_sha256":"2e536e8fb75319e6b2f3359bfa407734596ab15ca810ea425142686872dfa1ea","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"به ازای چند مقدار صحیح $m$، تابع $f(x) = \\frac{1}{3}x^3 - mx^2 + 4x$ در $\\mathbb{R}$، اکیداً صعودی است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$5$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به $\\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{f(x) - 2}{x^2 - 4} = 3$ واضح است $f(2) = 2$.\nبنابراین:\n$\\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{f(x) - f(2)}{(x-2)(x+2)} = \\frac{1}{4} f'(2) = 3 \\Rightarrow f'(2) = 12$\nحال $(fof)'(2)$ را به دست می‌آوریم:\n$(fof)'(2) = f'(2)f'(f(2)) = f'(2)f'(2) = 12^2 = 144$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1250,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":2,"solution_page":117,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1251","source_sha256":"b46ef23cebe1d231063ebd4c519ac5bc8e4f65e93bd93c46392e8618a8ec196f","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"مجموعه طول نقاط بحرانی تابع با ضابطه $f(x) = |x - 2|\\sqrt[3]{x^2}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\{0, \\frac{4}{5}, 2\\}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\{0, \\frac{2}{3}, 2\\}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\{0, 1\\}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\{\\frac{2}{3}, 2\\}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"از دو طرف تساوی $fog(x) = x^3 - 5x$ مشتق می‌گیریم:\n$(fog)'(x) = 3x^2 - 5 \\Rightarrow g'(x)f'(g(x)) = 3x^2 - 5$\nاز طرفی $f'(x) = \\frac{2}{x} \\Rightarrow f'(g(x)) = \\frac{2}{g(x)}$\n$\\Rightarrow 2 \\times \\frac{g'(x)}{g(x)} = 3x^2 - 5 \\xrightarrow{x=2} 2 \\times \\frac{g'(2)}{g(2)} = 7$\n$\\Rightarrow (\\frac{g'}{g})(2) = \\frac{7}{2} = 3/5$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1251,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":2,"solution_page":117,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1252","source_sha256":"4ec04f2c778a9e01d0296c139edb7572eca89da40d9ef3dd9c4691f5cf7946a5","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در تابع با ضابطه $f(x) = x|x| - 2x$ فاصله دو نقطه ماکزیمم نسبی و مینیمم نسبی آن، کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$2\\sqrt{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3\\sqrt{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا $(fog)'(x)$ را به دست می‌آوریم:\n$fog(x) = x + \\sqrt[3]{x} \\Rightarrow (fog)'(x) = 1 + \\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{x^2}}$\n$\\Rightarrow g'(x)f'(g(x)) = 1 + \\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{x^2}} \\xrightarrow{f'(x) = \\frac{4}{x}} g'(x) \\times \\frac{4}{g(x)}$\n$= 1 + \\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{x^2}} \\xrightarrow{x=1} \\frac{4g'(1)}{g(1)} = \\frac{4}{3} \\Rightarrow \\frac{g'(1)}{g(1)} = \\frac{1}{3}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1252,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":3,"solution_page":117,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1253","source_sha256":"8991665da5f7788567f396bb47ad63609e2a5132d400ef25e3a6f2bedc1cfb8f","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"مقدار ماکزیمم نسبی تابع با ضابطه $f(x) = \\frac{x^2 + 2x - 3}{x^2 + 1}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$-1 + \\sqrt{5}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1 + \\sqrt{5}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-1 + \\sqrt{3}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1 + \\sqrt{3}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا $f'(x)$ و $g'(x)$ را به دست می‌آوریم (مشتق $f$ را در همسایگی $x=2$ حساب می‌کنیم):\n$f(x)=1+2x^2 \\Rightarrow f'(x)=4x$\n$g(x)=\\frac{x}{1+x} \\Rightarrow g'(x)=\\frac{1}{(x+1)^2}$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$(fog)'(2)=f'(2)g'(f(2))=f'(2)g'(9)=8\\times\\frac{1}{100}=0.08$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1253,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":3,"solution_page":117,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1254","source_sha256":"69364c41c72e0a9181e017cef1499b4afbb35d8f0328c145a3e9a7a680730f46","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"فاصله نقطه ماکزیمم نسبی تابع با ضابطه $f(x) = x + \\sqrt{4x - x^2}$ از نیمساز ناحیه اول کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2\\sqrt{2}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"$f'(x)$ را به دست می‌آوریم:\n$f(x) = \\frac{1}{3}x + \\sqrt{x+1} \\Rightarrow f'(x) = \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x+1}}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} f(3) = 3 \\\\ f'(3) = \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{7}{12} \\end{cases}$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$y' = (fof(\\frac{1}{x}))' = (f(\\frac{1}{x}))' f'(f(\\frac{1}{x})) = -\\frac{1}{x^2} f'(\\frac{1}{x}) f'(f(\\frac{1}{x}))$\n$\\xrightarrow{x = \\frac{1}{3}} y' = -9 f'(3) f'(f(3)) = -9 f'(3) f'(3) = -9 (\\frac{7}{12})^2$\n$= -\\frac{49}{16}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1254,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":3,"solution_page":118,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1255","source_sha256":"79421f04ad40b488b5c9a8c041cfce070a0f3d7be376dff42d640a5303cdcab9","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در تابع با ضابطه $f(x) = x|x| - 2x$ فاصله دو نقطه ماکزیمم نسبی و مینیمم نسبی آن، کدام است؟ (سراسری ۹۸)"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۲۵۵","aspect_ratio":0.056}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$2\\sqrt{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.4459}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.6111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3\\sqrt{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.4024}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.569}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"در همسایگی $x = -1$ عبارت $|x|$ برابر $-x$ است. بنابراین:\n$f(x) = 3x^2 - x \\Rightarrow f'(x) = 6x - 1$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$y = f(\\sqrt{f(x)}) \\Rightarrow y' = (\\sqrt{f(x)})' f'(\\sqrt{f(x)})$\n$= \\frac{f'(x)}{2\\sqrt{f(x)}} f'(\\sqrt{f(x)}) \\xrightarrow{x=-1} y' = \\frac{f'(-1)}{2\\sqrt{f(-1)}} f'(\\sqrt{f(-1)})$\n$= \\frac{-7}{4} f'(2) = \\frac{-7}{4} \\times 13 = \\frac{-91}{4} = -22/75$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"15a3a2fc4a8eb425b2ab061878a49eae2db6546b68cf83cec80dea769331d16c","bytes":1322},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"03f796b3b2b3410aee7b5d26f3ae4d54811bf5532eb9a8e9a38b25c21d4cd699","bytes":1172},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"c6a2d373dba3ed1539a76fa67cd00d01f29ffda72a5356c005d45d2de81205a9","bytes":960},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"a527606d22192ba8a9abefc8aededfe0d269ec404d2cb989f13af367118fed6e","bytes":1156},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1255/stem_1.webp","sha256":"b37380bc1cee3d9dc5c02d959d433b3ffd6f0326ec729db20459f44662422c35","bytes":14942}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1255,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":4,"solution_page":118,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1256","source_sha256":"2f2cc61d35f15ef787b860e9cbdb1523f9b910dfee867c43c02241199de087a3","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"مقدار ماکزیمم نسبی تابع با ضابطه $\\displaystyle f(x) = \\frac{x^2 + 2x - 3}{x^2 + 1}$ کدام است؟ (سراسری ۹۹)"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۲۵۶","aspect_ratio":0.0982}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$-1 + \\sqrt{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.3514}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1 + \\sqrt{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.4216}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-1 + \\sqrt{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.3319}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1 + \\sqrt{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.3768}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا $f'(x)$ و $g'(x)$ را به دست می‌آوریم:\n$f(x) = \\frac{x^2 - 3}{x} = x - \\frac{3}{x} \\Rightarrow f'(x) = 1 + \\frac{3}{x^2} \\Rightarrow f'(4) = \\frac{19}{16}$\n$g(x) = \\frac{3x - 4}{\\sqrt{x}} \\Rightarrow g'(x) = \\frac{3\\sqrt{x} - \\frac{3x - 4}{2\\sqrt{x}}}{x} \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} g(4) = 4 \\\\ g'(4) = 1 \\end{cases}$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$y = (f+g)og(x) \\Rightarrow y' = g'(x)(f+g)'(g(x))$\n$\\Rightarrow y'(4) = g'(4)(f+g)'(g(4)) = 1 \\times (f+g)'(4)$\n$= f'(4) + g'(4) = \\frac{19}{16} + 1 = \\frac{35}{16}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"d88964edd2f0f79648c9b122adbaf0b9a36d7e96518c8d40f5bcdebd719f3a5f","bytes":1692},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"e78db951c926d44937004b9b1135da277b685e91a10bf95f11587065c9dfe85a","bytes":1652},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"b5bfbdf0bcae82148eef25383035cb2cf03d8e6c56cfe6d26da162ec9d50c9e1","bytes":2470},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"83aae8453bcba8b922928f1485ae4dad828abc05fdcc8b317d222d3695e88ab2","bytes":3286},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1256/stem_1.webp","sha256":"cac82e9e610fcab581d3ea0b79b7ce38c0517abb72ab4d7c2653c72c4832e505","bytes":10858}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1256,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":4,"solution_page":118,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1257","source_sha256":"7a99138cedb99510865ac69bd59cb15f1b04ab0f70975528db7a7b38cb45e48c","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"فاصله نقطه ماکزیمم نسبی تابع با ضابطه $f(x) = x + \\sqrt{4x - x^2}$ از نیمساز ناحیه اول کدام است؟ (سراسری ۹۹)"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۲۵۷","aspect_ratio":0.0566}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.6632}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.5238}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.7875}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2\\sqrt{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.443}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"می‌توانیم $f'$ و $g'$ را به دست آورده، مقدار خواسته شده را محاسبه می‌کنیم. اما با کمی دقت درمی‌یابیم که:\n$f'(g(2))g'(2) = (fog)'(2)$\nتابع $fog(x)$ را تشکیل می‌دهیم:\n$f(x) = \\frac{x^2 - 6x + 1}{x^2 - 6x - 2} = \\frac{(x-3)^2 - 8}{(x-3)^2 - 11}$\n$\\Rightarrow fog(x) = \\frac{(g(x)-3)^2 - 8}{(g(x)-3)^2 - 11} = \\frac{x - 8}{x - 11}$\nبنابراین:\n$(fog)'(x) = \\frac{-11+8}{(x-11)^2} = \\frac{-3}{(x-11)^2} \\Rightarrow (fog)'(2) = \\frac{-3}{81} = \\frac{-1}{27}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"373044f9bfba5bed4d3ebef9f65c05583aae04d776c3a26ba5d7ce9fa703b4d2","bytes":1006},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"26a57cd84645e3be3ae2a3a6970c7d7a3ae324fd1db8e3ce7d6d20dd1ff39982","bytes":1246},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"19d93c7d415d0bbe8d8a32b1f25498e3bf7d828d580b733c99762dc9128652a0","bytes":76},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"b9b831a006c06d117c98721bb1cc29f0357450426c77544f3e70786908dc9ca8","bytes":1540},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1257/stem_1.webp","sha256":"a740ef3ddf414a1efe8604ff5f4d03af7c9e89a8efc327382c8bca153b93a12b","bytes":9414}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1257,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":4,"solution_page":118,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1258","source_sha256":"fcf2536bb6f9a18160c54dbe07d4b398f134356c4f52215686aae250ab556d65","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"شکل روبه‌رو، نمودار تابع $f(x) = 3x^4 + ax^3 + bx^2 + cx$ است. $a$ کدام است؟ (سراسری ۹۸)"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۲۵۸ و نمودار","aspect_ratio":0.0844}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$-8$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.3789}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-7$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.3207}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-5$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.3478}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-4$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.3043}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا $fog(x)$ را به دست می‌آوریم:\n$fog(x) = \\frac{xg(x)}{\\sqrt{1+g^2(x)}} = \\frac{x \\frac{x}{\\sqrt{4-x^2}}}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac{x^2}{4-x^2}}} = \\frac{\\frac{x^2}{\\sqrt{4-x^2}}}{\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4-x^2}}} = \\frac{x^2}{2}$\nبنابراین:\n$(fog)'(x) = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 2x = x \\Rightarrow (fog)'(\\frac{1}{2}) = \\frac{1}{2}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"d16bfd9a2393cbb821248c37c77d3749dd4bba2531502b79386f10b0ccd6dc07","bytes":1492},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"c94bc27b1cab957994c2b46a307f32a3909eff498dba99afe6ae85c4b385c92b","bytes":1752},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"598fdbd9b0396c7eb2d19f0ce5cdcdf1ef1fc6b4f4d4e76ccb60de5ee39a2208","bytes":1054},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"b9400645c7dcc91a26a0fe4cae47ebe80b88b8922cdd96aed825bc94f9f8d613","bytes":1562},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1258/stem_1.webp","sha256":"c704ad48bf715e7fff8729ed482422156e74db8d3b5a242afafad444b29c33bd","bytes":36144}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1258,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":5,"solution_page":118,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1259","source_sha256":"4acdbebd60c467c03355b68949b5853b4d8c1a93319d7448266e4b7fdf585f49","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"مقادیر ماکزیمم و مینیمم مطلق تابع با ضابطه $f(x) = \\frac{1}{3}x^3 - x^2 - 15x$ در بازه $[-4, 3]$ کدام است؟ (سراسری ۹۵)"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۲۵۹","aspect_ratio":0.0552}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$-18$ و $24$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.1816}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-45$ و $27$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.1525}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-36$ و $27$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.1694}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-27$ و $36$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.1736}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا $fog(x)$ را تشکیل می‌دهیم:\n$1) \\ x \\ge 0 \\Rightarrow g(x) = 2x \\Rightarrow fog(x) = \\frac{3}{4}(2x) + \\frac{1}{4}|2x| = \\frac{6}{4}x + \\frac{2}{4}x = 2x$\n$2) \\ x < 0 \\Rightarrow g(x) = 4x \\Rightarrow fog(x) = \\frac{3}{4}(4x) + \\frac{1}{4}|4x| = 3x - x = 2x$\n$(1), (2) \\Rightarrow fog(x) = 2x \\Rightarrow (fog)'(x) = 2$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"2cad2cefd1ed8b268a0c29b3d3ee4e7b588f2feaf4ff8ceef59dc02855cf152f","bytes":3126},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"67160ba34aa099a0904e7b1547a6f09df2f8f2fd3929a51238c6eb05c4d0b8ec","bytes":5884},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"b3fefa7f689b06ed0c57b396fde53ebf82e271a420f5ebd81e688ac2f228fd39","bytes":7334},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"47db801f4e2bed4b90c9fc30a58f7f764d6f3755ccadda30e64adec37a619560","bytes":4932},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1259/stem_1.webp","sha256":"2850ad5d7f495f370a87b3d21f8bf279af203376a0ad0457bceaa38a73b97050","bytes":27962}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1259,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":5,"solution_page":118,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1260","source_sha256":"3f3cc801ec3320ad4fa7aa7de02c76c41064cfb15b6a99fbcd3e5e0efa634992","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"مینیمم مطلق تابع $f(x) = |x^2 - 3|$ در بازه $[-1/5, \\sqrt{3}]$ کدام است؟ (سراسری ۱۴۰۰)"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۲۶۰","aspect_ratio":0.0558}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$-\\frac{9}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.4695}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-2$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.2711}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-\\sqrt{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.3466}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-\\frac{9}{8}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.5725}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $f$ درجه $n$ باشد، $f'$ درجه $(n-1)$ است؛ بنابراین $f'(x^3)$ درجه $3(n-1)$ بوده و $(f'(x^3))^2$ درجه $6(n-1)$ است.\n$f$ درجه ۳ است؛ بنابراین $f'of'(x^3)$ درجه $3(2^2)$ یعنی ۱۲ است."}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"2d60214ca5662d14161ce3583d140aba47eb13f4b89fa91617d33a8c198367de","bytes":828},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"4ca0af6e7344abdc7ffda3b625c288a545473d00717cd58e30aa6c643d6b1ee1","bytes":2008},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"95d52f511015ab37c5aacad3a5b019a39ab55f3bf6767c99f0a3dafc6669d294","bytes":3280},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"25cf71d0125667862292f2211f23bf632f3ac917d9a4fcf3a5ea6e320fd4ad0b","bytes":3000},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1260/stem_1.webp","sha256":"de555155c9608446f2997bf34a991685d0baf1fe44ffdfd1bfd932e5543eeb25","bytes":11694}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1260,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":5,"solution_page":118,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1261","source_sha256":"960a52cf7422a01d35765c58724c7a26f986e91cf29817f777c3f846a54f6d4d","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"کم‌ترین مقدار تابع $y = \\frac{1}{4}x^4 - x^3 - 2x^2$ کدام است؟ (سراسری ۹۲)"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$-36$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-32$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-24$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-18$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"$f$ تابع درجه ۲ است؛ بنابراین: $f(x) = ax^2 + bx + c$\n$\\Rightarrow f'(x) = 2ax + b$\n$\\Rightarrow fof'(x) = a(2ax+b)^2 + b(2ax+b) + c = 4x^2 - 6x + 5$\n$\\Rightarrow 4a^3x^2 + (4a^2b + 2ab)x + ab^2 + b^2 + c = 4x^2 - 6x + 5$\n$\\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} 4a^3 = 4 \\Rightarrow a = 1 \\\\ 4a^2b + 2ab = -6 \\Rightarrow 6b = -6 \\Rightarrow b = -1 \\\\ ab^2 + b^2 + c = 5 \\Rightarrow 2 + c = 5 \\Rightarrow c = 3 \\end{cases}$\n$\\Rightarrow f(x) = x^2 - x + 3 \\Rightarrow f'(x) = 2x - 1$\n$\\Rightarrow f(2)f'(2) = 5 \\times 3 = 15$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1261,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":118,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1262","source_sha256":"c7ca54faef87d4acfe217ecdaf8f9aab39efae85ae8838aef53b1ef8c3697b29","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"برد تابع $y = x + \\sqrt{8-x^2}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$[-4, 2\\sqrt{2}]$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$[-4, 4]$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$[-2\\sqrt{2}, 2\\sqrt{2}]$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$[-2\\sqrt{2}, 4]$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"تابع $y = [\\frac{x}{2}]$ در نقاط $x = 2, 4, 6, \\dots$ ناپیوسته و در نتیجه مشتق‌ناپذیر است. تابع $y = [\\frac{x+2}{3}]$ در نقاط $x = 4, 7, 10, \\dots$ ناپیوسته و در نتیجه مشتق‌ناپذیر است. بنابراین اولین نقطه‌ای که تابع $f(x)$ در بازهٔ $(1, +\\infty)$ در آن مشتق‌ناپذیر است $x = 2$ می‌باشد. نتیجه می‌گیریم حداکثر مقدار $k$ برابر ۲ است."}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1262,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":118,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1263","source_sha256":"e6d1a98f3db27fc59c49b13f0a7eabd65c2c9a1c3ad07a9da4e5b64dae9e9948","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"بیشترین مساحت مستطیلی که یک ضلع آن بر قطر نیم‌دایره به شعاع ۶ واحد و دو رأس دیگر آن روی این نیم‌دایره باشد، کدام است؟ (سراسری ۹۸)"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1263/stem_1.webp","alt":"مستطیل محاط در نیم‌دایره","aspect_ratio":0.675}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$18$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$24$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$27$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$36$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"حد تابع $y = \\frac{3}{x-1}$ در $-\\infty$ برابر صفر است، برای این‌که تابع $f(x) = [\\frac{3}{x-1}]$ پیوسته و در نتیجه مشتق‌پذیر باشد، باید عبارت \\frac{3}{x-1} در بازهٔ $(-1, 0]$ باشد. بنابراین حداکثر مقدار $\\alpha$ برابر $-2$ است.\n$\\frac{3}{x-1} \\ge -1 \\Rightarrow \\frac{x+2}{x-1} \\ge 0 \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} x \\le -2 \\quad \\checkmark \\\\ x \\ge 1 \\quad \\text{غ ق ق} \\end{cases}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1263/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1263/stem_1.webp","sha256":"b7c41c22d44dd37fe3678858d97926c15bfe8613e2456a5fd12f8a7a1f2e94aa","bytes":1058}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1263,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":118,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1264","source_sha256":"20d8069e8518220e6033ce38f90f7d61762adeecb01c00ab6b74a26800bc79bd","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"حداکثر مساحت جانبی استوانه‌ای که درون یک کره به شعاع $4\\sqrt{2}$ محاط می‌شود، کدام است؟ (سراسری ۱۴۰۰)"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1264/stem_1.webp","alt":"استوانه محاط در کره","aspect_ratio":0.8089}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$32\\pi$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$64\\pi$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{256\\pi}{3}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{512\\pi}{3}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"برای این‌که تابع $f(x)$ در $x=4$ مشتق‌پذیر باشد، باید در این نقطه پیوسته بوده و مشتق چپ و راست آن برابر باشد.\n$\\text{شرط پیوستگی} \\Rightarrow a\\sqrt{x}+1 = x - \\frac{b}{x} \\xrightarrow{x=4} 2a + 1 = 4 - \\frac{b}{4}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{b}{4} = 3 - 2a$\n$\\text{برابری مشتق چپ و راست} \\Rightarrow \\frac{a}{2\\sqrt{x}} = 1 + \\frac{b}{x^2} \\xrightarrow{x=4} \\frac{a}{4} = 1 + \\frac{b}{16}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{a}{4} = 1 + \\frac{3-2a}{4} \\Rightarrow a = 4 + 3 - 2a \\Rightarrow a = \\frac{7}{3} \\Rightarrow b = \\frac{-20}{3}$\n$\\Rightarrow a - b = \\frac{7}{3} + \\frac{20}{3} = 9$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1264/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1264/stem_1.webp","sha256":"654d5208e5508e37eebfe57c5a75bb357132043b3c843ca5145c576b26bc8077","bytes":202}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1264,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":118,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1265","source_sha256":"dbfa4bb904d965e4ba65bec46b5b9f2f7e9d78866217c34b98ea12167a727ce6","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"کوتاه‌ترین فاصلۀ سهمی $y^2 = 4x$ از نقطۀ $M(3, 0)$ کدام است؟ (سراسری ۱۴۰۰)"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{3}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2\\sqrt{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"تابع $f$ در $x=-1$ مشتق‌پذیر است. بنابراین در این نقطه پیوسته بوده و $f'_+(-1)=f'_(-1)$.\nشرط پیوستگی $\\xrightarrow{x=-1} \\sqrt[3]{(3x-5)^2} = ax+b$\n$\\longrightarrow 4 = -a+b$\n$f'_+(-1) = f'_(-1) \\xrightarrow{x=-1} \\frac{6}{3\\sqrt[3]{3x-5}} = a \\xrightarrow{x=-1} a = \\frac{6}{-6} = -1$\n$\\Rightarrow b = a+4 = 3$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1265,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":119,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1266","source_sha256":"2b72a45d7911e940477c14321bf7501fe2390aa3b6efe3806073344cfdf1fa60","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"طول وتر یک مثلث قائم‌الزاویه برابر ۸ است. حداکثر مساحت این مثلث چه‌قدر است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1266/stem_1.webp","alt":"مثلث قائم‌الزاویه با وتر ۸ و اضلاع a و b","aspect_ratio":0.8167}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$8\\sqrt{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$16\\sqrt{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$32$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$16$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"تابع $f$ در $x=2$ مشتق‌پذیر است. بنابراین در این نقطه پیوسته بوده و $f'_+(2)=f'_-(2)$.\nشرط پیوستگی $\\xrightarrow{x=2} x^2-ax+b = \\frac{4}{x}+1$\n$\\longrightarrow 4-2a+b=2+1 \\Rightarrow 2a-b=1$\n$f'_+(2)=f'_-(2) \\longrightarrow 2x-a = \\frac{-4}{x^2} \\xrightarrow{x=2} 4-a=-1$\n$\\Rightarrow a=5 \\Rightarrow b=9$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1266/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1266/stem_1.webp","sha256":"6966a702ea0ceafeed34436d394fc81dbea936bf6181939c38b59371f3550699","bytes":3878}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1266,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":119,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true}]}
